      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1787594436",
      "delta": "Block\",\"props\":{\"variant\":\"insight\",\"content\":\"The jump month was $result:jump_month, when net MRR rose by $result:jump_net_mrr_delta_usd. New subsc"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1787594436",
      "delta": "riptions accounted for $result:jump_new_mrr_contribution_usd of the gain, expansion revenue for $result:jump_expansion_mrr_contribution_usd,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1787594436",
      "delta": " and churn offset the gross gain by $result:jump_churn_drag_usd. The $result:jump_leading_plan plan was the primary contributor"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1787594436",
      "delta": ", adding $result:jump_leading_plan_delta_usd in net MRR. The dominant driver of the jump was the $result:jump_dominant_driver component"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1787594436",
      "delta": ", as shown in the decomposition waterfall above.\"},\"children\":[]}}\n{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/elements/methodology-text\",\"value\":{\"type\":\"TextBlock\",\"props\":{\"variant\":\"body\",\"content\":\"This"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1787594436",
      "delta": " analysis used 36 records spanning 12 months and 3 plans. For each month, new MRR, expansion MRR, and churn MRR were sum"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1787594436",
      "delta": "med across all plans. The month-over-month net delta was computed as the sum of new plus expansion minus churn. The month with the highest net delta was identified as the jump month, and"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1787594436",
      "delta": " its gross components were decomposed to explain the source of the gain. The per-plan breakdown shows how each plan contributed to the jump month total"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1787594436",
